## Scope and acceptance criteria
For normal/ghost (non-free) blocks, the pos column must display `--`, not a computed grid-cell midpoint. Midpoint (32x8x32 m cell) is the T19 sort key only; the later “their pos should be the midpoint” sentence was about sorting, not a retraction of the display rule. Free blocks still show actual transforms. Baked pos display was never specified as `--`. Current T16 implementation shows midpoints in the pos column, so this is outstanding.

